--- !u!114 &310174875
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 310174870}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 06343b4e357c57e4b9a009d1821ec73a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _nameText: {fileID: 643783050}
  _dialogueText: {fileID: 189994297}
  _continueButton: {fileID: 417040262}
  _dialogueBox: {fileID: 693617069}
  _sentences:
  - So... chaos falls silent once more.
  - You have struck down Seth, yet victory alone does not restore balance.
  - Strength ends conflict, but truth decides what remains.
  - I am Ma'at.
  - Order. Balance. The weight that binds the gods to consequence.
  - Seth's heart still beats with defiance.
  - It must be weighed, not destroyed.
  - Take my feather.
  - This is the measure of truth. No blade may replace it, and no god may defy it.
  - With this, you will judge his soul.
  - You will decide whether he is bound, or allowed to rise again to face judgment
    anew.
  - But heed this warning, Anubis...
  - Each soul you weigh will test more than theirs.
  - The deeper you descend, the heavier truth will become.
  - Balance is not mercy.
  - Balance is not cruelty.
  - It simply is.
  - Proceed.
  _featherImage: {fileID: 535779973}
